{"PageNumber":445,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":71,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَوَلَمۡ يَرَوۡاْ أَنَّا خَلَقۡنَا لَهُم مِّمَّا عَمِلَتۡ أَيۡدِينَآ أَنۡعَٰمٗا فَهُمۡ لَهَا مَٰلِكُونَ","TajweedText":"أَوَلَمْ يَرَوْ<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> أَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا خَلَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed>نَا لَه<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ِّ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا عَمِلَتْ أَيْدِين<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَنْعَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed><tajweed class=ikhafa>مًا ف</tajweed>َهُمْ لَهَا مَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>لِك<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧١</span>","End":"٧١","PageNumber":445,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":385,"MaqraNumber":178,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":72,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَذَلَّلۡنَٰهَا لَهُمۡ فَمِنۡهَا رَكُوبُهُمۡ وَمِنۡهَا يَأۡكُلُونَ","TajweedText":"وَذَلَّلْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هَا لَهُمْ فَمِنْهَا رَكُوبُهُمْ وَمِنْهَا يَأْكُل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧٢</span>","End":"٧٢","PageNumber":445,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":385,"MaqraNumber":178,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":73,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَلَهُمۡ فِيهَا مَنَٰفِعُ وَمَشَارِبُۚ أَفَلَا يَشۡكُرُونَ","TajweedText":"وَلَهُمْ فِيهَا مَنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>فِعُ وَمَشَارِبُ‌ۖ أَفَلَا يَشْكُر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧٣</span>","End":"٧٣","PageNumber":445,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":385,"MaqraNumber":178,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":74,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَٱتَّخَذُواْ مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ ءَالِهَةٗ لَّعَلَّهُمۡ يُنصَرُونَ","TajweedText":"وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>تَّخَذُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن د</tajweed>ُونِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>للَّهِ ءَالِهَ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ةً ل</tajweed>َّعَلَّهُمْ يُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نص</tajweed>َر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧٤</span>","End":"٧٤","PageNumber":445,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":385,"MaqraNumber":178,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":75,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"لَا يَسۡتَطِيعُونَ نَصۡرَهُمۡ وَهُمۡ لَهُمۡ جُندٞ مُّحۡضَرُونَ","TajweedText":"لَا يَسْتَطِيعُونَ نَصْرَهُمْ وَهُمْ لَهُمْ جُن<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>دٌ م</tajweed>ُّحْضَر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧٥</span>","End":"٧٥","PageNumber":445,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":385,"MaqraNumber":178,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":76,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَلَا يَحۡزُنكَ قَوۡلُهُمۡۘ إِنَّا نَعۡلَمُ مَا يُسِرُّونَ وَمَا يُعۡلِنُونَ","TajweedText":"فَلَا يَحْزُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نك</tajweed>َ قَوْلُهُمْ‌ۘ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا نَعْلَمُ مَا يُسِرُّونَ وَمَا يُعْلِن<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٧٦</span>","End":"٧٦","PageNumber":445,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":385,"MaqraNumber":178,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":77,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَوَلَمۡ يَرَ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ أَنَّا خَلَقۡنَٰهُ مِن نُّطۡفَةٖ فَإِذَا هُوَ خَصِيمٞ مُّبِينٞ","TajweedText":"أَوَلَمْ يَرَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْإِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نس</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>نُ أَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا خَلَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed>نَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُ م<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ِن ن</tajweed>ُّ<tajweed class=qalaqah>طْ</tajweed>فَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ةٍ ف</tajweed>َإِذَا هُوَ خَصِي<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>مٌ م</tajweed>ُّب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نٌ <span class=end>٧٧</span>","End":"٧٧","PageNumber":445,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":385,"MaqraNumber":178,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":78,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَضَرَبَ لَنَا مَثَلٗا وَنَسِيَ خَلۡقَهُۥۖ قَالَ مَن يُحۡيِ ٱلۡعِظَٰمَ وَهِيَ رَمِيمٞ","TajweedText":"وَضَرَبَ لَنَا مَثَل<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>اً و</tajweed>َنَسِىَ خَلْقَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed>‌ۖ قَالَ م<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>َن ي</tajweed>ُحْىِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْعِظَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>مَ وَهِىَ رَم<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مٌ <span class=end>٧٨</span>","End":"٧٨","PageNumber":445,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":385,"MaqraNumber":178,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":79,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قُلۡ يُحۡيِيهَا ٱلَّذِيٓ أَنشَأَهَآ أَوَّلَ مَرَّةٖۖ وَهُوَ بِكُلِّ خَلۡقٍ عَلِيمٌ","TajweedText":"قُلْ يُحْيِيهَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِىٓ</tajweed> أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نش</tajweed>َأَه<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَوَّلَ مَرَّ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ةٍ‌ۖ و</tajweed>َهُوَ بِكُلِّ خَلْقٍ عَل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مٌ <span class=end>٧٩</span>","End":"٧٩","PageNumber":445,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":385,"MaqraNumber":178,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":80,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"ٱلَّذِي جَعَلَ لَكُم مِّنَ ٱلشَّجَرِ ٱلۡأَخۡضَرِ نَارٗا فَإِذَآ أَنتُم مِّنۡهُ تُوقِدُونَ","TajweedText":"ٱلَّذِى جَعَلَ لَك<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ِّنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>شَّجَرِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَخْضَرِ نَا<tajweed class=ikhafa>رًا ف</tajweed>َإِذ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نت</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>ِّنْهُ تُوقِد<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٨٠</span>","End":"٨٠","PageNumber":445,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":385,"MaqraNumber":178,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":81,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَوَلَيۡسَ ٱلَّذِي خَلَقَ ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَٱلۡأَرۡضَ بِقَٰدِرٍ عَلَىٰٓ أَن يَخۡلُقَ مِثۡلَهُمۚ بَلَىٰ وَهُوَ ٱلۡخَلَّـٰقُ ٱلۡعَلِيمُ","TajweedText":"أَوَلَيْسَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِى خَلَقَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>سَّمَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>و<tajweed class=madda_normal>َٲ</tajweed>تِ وَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَرْضَ بِقَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>دِرٍ عَلَ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ىٰٓ</tajweed> أ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>َن ي</tajweed>َخْلُقَ مِثْلَه<tajweed class=ikhafa_shafawi>ُم‌ۚ ب</tajweed>َلَىٰ وَهُوَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْخَلَّ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>قُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْعَل<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مُ <span class=end>٨١</span>","End":"٨١","PageNumber":445,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":385,"MaqraNumber":178,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":82,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِنَّمَآ أَمۡرُهُۥٓ إِذَآ أَرَادَ شَيۡـًٔا أَن يَقُولَ لَهُۥ كُن فَيَكُونُ","TajweedText":"إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َم<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَمْرُهُ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ۥٓ</tajweed> إِذ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَرَادَ شَيْــًٔا أ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>َن ي</tajweed>َقُولَ لَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> كُ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ف</tajweed>َيَك<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نُ <span class=end>٨٢</span>","End":"٨٢","PageNumber":445,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":385,"MaqraNumber":178,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":36,"SurahIndex":"036","VerseNumber":83,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَسُبۡحَٰنَ ٱلَّذِي بِيَدِهِۦ مَلَكُوتُ كُلِّ شَيۡءٖ وَإِلَيۡهِ تُرۡجَعُونَ","TajweedText":"فَسُ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>حَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>نَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِى بِيَدِه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> مَلَكُوتُ كُلِّ ش<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>َىْءٍ و</tajweed>َإِلَيْهِ تُرْجَع<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٨٣</span>","End":"٨٣","PageNumber":445,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":385,"MaqraNumber":178,"HizbNumber":45,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false}]}